        "desc": "<p>步骤详实的食谱，记载着「蜜金泡果」的制作方法。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/03/07/88072335/60c9c277139b43907167e6452d409874_8786279026489504137.png",
